<title>CHINA: China Jan-April antimony exports up 21.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-April antimony exports up 21.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought antimony reached 11,254 tonnes in the first four months, up 21.8 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p> EXPORTS     JAN-APRIL     APRIL   YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Antimony     11,254	 3,769	+21.8</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
